WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Come on. We shouldn't stay here.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Wait. I can feel it... We are not alone.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Holy Light, how many of them... That's a real hive!

4
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:30.500
Hurry, come over here! I will protect you with a mental shield... But it won't last long!

5
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.500
Adaptation. This is curious. Your ways deserve a research.

6
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Do not resist. The quicker the transmutation goes, the better it is for you.

7
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:46.500
I can sense someone else's presence... Some evil will...

8
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.500
Heart of the Hive?

9
00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:01.500
If it is so, we need to reach it... and destroy it!

10
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:11.500
Attack! For the Light!
